“Several safety and robustness features were implemented to preventunstable or unsafe
behaviour.”

“The turret is prevented from firing into a restricted angular sector where the Search
Radar is located.”

“ATLAS also automatically resets if a target is lost, moves out of range, or if
engagement confidence becomes unreliable.”

“Because the perception system is radar-based rather than camera-based, the system
remains robust under visibility or lighting changes.”

“ATLAS also implements adaptive attack-pattern prediction.”

“The attacker launches projectiles according to clustered launch regions and timing
patterns.”

“Over time, the system learns these attack tendencies and begins pre-positioning the
turret before the next projectile is launched.”
